  ('ds_portfolio_syn', 'Synthetic insurer portfolio', 'Generated by FloodSense EU', 'FloodSense EU team', 'https://github.com/GenAI-Open-Agent-Hackathon/Hackathon-Monorepo/blob/main/ingestion/prep/synthetic_portfolio.py', 'Generated (no third-party rights)', 'Synthetic portfolio generated for the demo. Not real policies', '2026-10-23', 'portfolio_synthetic.csv', 'Fixed seed 773. No personal data'),
